 end="00:24.700">Cause </span><span begin="00:24.700" end="00:25.320">thoughts </span><span begin="00:25.320" end="00:27.120">devour</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.120" end="00:31.170"><span begin="00:27.120" end="00:27.880">Thoughts </span><span begin="00:27.880" end="00:28.450">of </span><span begin="00:28.450" end="00:28.950">you </span><span begin="00:28.950" end="00:31.170">consume</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.090" end="00:49.810"><span begin="00:44.090" end="00:45.043">I </span><span begin="00:45.043" end="00:45.996">can't </span><span begin="00:45.996" end="00:46.949">help </span><span begin="00:46.949" end="00:47.902">but </span><span begin="00:47.902" end="00:48.855">love </span><span begin="00:48.855" end="00:49.810">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.740" end="00:59.160"><span begin="00:53.740" end="00:54.490">Even </span><span begin="00:54.490" end="00:55.130">though </span><span begin="00:55.130" end="00:55.580">I </span><span begin="00:55.580" end="00:56.180">try </span><span begin="00:56.180" end="00:58.630">not </span><span begin="00:58.630" end="00:59.160">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.570" end="01:02.940"><span begin="00:59.570" end="00:59.910">I </span><span begin="00:59.910" end="01:00.420">can't </span><span begin="01:00.420" end="01:00.810">help </span><span begin="01:00.810" end="01:01.090">but </span><span begin="01:01.090" end="01:02.480">want </span><span begin="01:02.480" end="01:02.940">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.570" end="01:11.820"><span begin="01:03.570" end="01:03.980">I </span><span begin="01:03.980" end="01:04.460">know </span><span begin="01:04.460" end="01:04.720">that </span><span begin="01:04.720" end="01:05.290">I'd </span><span begin="01:05.290" end="01:05.570">die </span><span begin="01:05.570" end="01:11.760">without </span><span begin="01:11.760" end="01:11.820">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.490" end="01:20.740"><span begin="01:15.490" end="01:16